(:id "port/python/vt/enum-keyed-arrays" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/pythontable/vtkeyed_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtKeyedRows (every manifest instance and report row whose root reaches a keyed array, 41 rows with a completeness check; the form-1 copy of each accepted fixed-root instance; luatable's unions_maps_keyed construct)" "internal/codegen/pythontable/vtkeyed_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtKeyedRowsNegativeControl/variable-slots-descending, /fixed-slots-reversed (each fault planted in a COPY of the emitted runtime)" "internal/codegen/pythontable/vtkeyed_test.go: TestPythonVtKeyed, TestPythonVtKeyedNegativeControl" "make python-vt-keyed-rows python-vt-keyed-rows-negative-control (make/python-vt-keyed-rows.mk); make/negative-controls.d/python-vt-keyed-rows-negative-control.json") :tested-revision "ff91d3a12c39febc933f70db330c233233bb32e3" :note "2026-11-17: the enum-keyed array [E]T on the Python leg holds every conformance-manifest instance and report row whose root reaches a keyed array (the keyed demo, the rename pair, the scalar state and its narrower writer, the versioned config pair, the keyed arrays inside map values, and the previous_form rows of each fixed root), with no row skipped. Each row is read then written under both pinned interpreters (CPython 3.11.18 and 3.15.2): an instance saves back byte for byte with its measure its length, a report row answers reports.txt's verdict, and a refusal leaves the caller's buffer and LoadReport untouched. The manifest's keyed roots are fixed tables, read as form 3; each accepted one is also read on form 1 at the same root declared variable, so the keyed body (kind 16) is held on the manifest's own data, and luatable's unions_maps_keyed construct rides beside them. The manifest found no gap in kind_keyed.py. The negative control writes the variable form's keyed slots in descending order, then reads the fixed form's keyed slots in reverse, in a copy of the emitted runtime, and the rows with two or more distinct present slots on each form go red by name. Run on macOS arm64 at ff91d3a12c39febc933f70db330c233233bb32e3 with SCHEMA_SLOW=1, -tags schema_leg_python and make dist-python.")
